    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Ranal\nAmbassador\nTWA\nWans World Airlines",
      "Prior to Takeoff\nPremium champagne\nAfter Takeoff\nCocktail or beverage of your choice\nCured olives with herbs\nRoasted cashews\nAppetizers\nScottish smoked salmon, longtail shrimp,\nmesquite-marinated chicken breast and asparagus spears,\ngarnished with strawberry and kiwi,\nserved with wasabi sauce\nPlease accept our apology if your first entrée preference is not available.\nPassengers who prefer more time for work or sleep may request\nour Royal Ambassador Express Service.\nSalad\nAssortment of salad leaves,\ngarnished with cucumber slices, radishes and croutons\nChoice of balsamic vinaigrette or low-fat blue cheese dressing\nEntrées\nFilet Mignon\nServed with bordelaise sauce and Anna potatoes\nVeal Rib Chop\nServed with a broiled tomato and duchess sweet potatoes\nGrilled Breast of Chicken\nBoneless, served with forestière sauce, and new potato wedges with rosemary\nFillet of Salmon\nGrilled, enhanced by printemps sauce with scallions,\naccompanied by saffron rice\nMedallions of Lobster and Chateaubriand\nServed chilled with smoked turkey,\nartichoke salad and rémoulade sauce\nlot entrées will be accompanied by green beans with red pepper:\nDinner rolls and butter will be served with all entrées\nDessert\nAssortment of seasonal fruit and International cheeses\nHäagen-Dazs vanilla frozen yogurt and chocolate brownie loaf\nChocolate sauce\nAccompanied with coffee, decaffeinated coffee or tea\nContinental Breakfast Buffet\nDuty Free shopping available on today's flight.\nD65E 1/95\n20 26 u"
    ],
